---
title: A small conversation
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as API
    participant D as Database
    U->>+A: Sign in
    A->>+D: Find account
    D-->>-A: Account details
    alt Account exists
        A-->>U: Welcome back!
    else Unknown account
        A-->>U: Please register
    end
    A->>A: Update session
    A-->>-U: All done
    Note over U,D: Ready for the next request
